<headline>FINAL PRICING - Port of Seattle, Wash..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it received the written award for the $108.220 Port of Seattle, Wash., weekly variable rate subordinate lien revenue (AMT) bonds, Series 1997, with an initial rate of 3.50 percent in 2022.</p>
